===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|geometry}} A [[solid]] constructed by slicing a [[bicone]] with 90-degree [[apex|apices]] through a [[plane]] containing both of them, rotating one half by 90 degrees, and [[reconnect]]ing them; the resulting shape has a single continuous [[face]], and two edges.

